# ============================================================================
# Ancestria — .gitignore
#
# Policy: CODE ONLY. No raw/derived sequencing data (genomic data from real
# patients/participants, requires a controlled-access repository like
# dbGaP/EGA — see DATA_AVAILABILITY.md) and no results/manuscript/figures
# (generated locally by running the pipeline, not committed).
# ============================================================================

# ── Raw sequencing data (real patients/participants) ───────────────────────
bam/
*.bam
*.bam.bai
*.cram
*.cram.crai

# ── Results, manuscript, and deliverables (code-only repo policy) ──────────
# Per project decision: this repository ships CODE only. Results, figures,
# tables, and the manuscript are generated locally by running the pipeline
# (see bin/README_VIGENTE.md) but are not committed here.
out_global/
entregable_VCF/
manuscrito_G3/
results/
docs/
work/

# ── Large public reference downloads (reconstructible, don't upload) ───────
data/ref/*.fasta
data/ref/*.fasta.fai
data/ref/*.dict
data/vcf/
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.vcf

# ── Third-party tools vendored as full git repos ────────────────────────────
# Rebuilt via `git clone` + checkout to the exact commit documented in
# README.md, not vendored here (avoids nested git repos and useless bulk).
tools/angsd_src/
tools/varscan/*.jar
tools/mixemt/
tools/mixemt_venv/
data/iadmix/

# ── Failed downloads / junk / loose root-level duplicates ──────────────────
# (all of these are exact copies of what's already organized under
# manuscrito_G3/ — which itself is excluded above — or obsolete scratch
# files, verified with diff during the audit)
data/hgdp/
.freq
bin/.RData
Articulo_Ancestria.docx
Articulo_Ancestria.md
Articulo_Draft.docx
Articulo_Final.md
Delta11.png
DeltaN5.png
Deviation from full data estimates n10.png
Downsampling stability (N10).png
Downsampling stability (N11).png
Downsampling stability (N5).png
Fig N10-N11
Fig N10-N11-4
Fig N5
Fig N5-1
Fig_iAdmix_barplots2_doublecol.png
Fig_iAdmix_barplots_doublecol.png
Generaltables.tsv
Generaltables.xls
Mainfig
Mainfig2
Presentacion.md
Presentacion_Completa.md
Presentacion_Completa.pptx
Reporte.odt
Reporte3.docx
Reporte4.docx
Reporte4.md
Reporte_ANGSD_Metodologia.docx
Reporte_ANGSD_Metodologia.md
Reporte_ANGSD_MetodologiaA.docx
Resumen_Ejecutivo.docx
Resumen_Ejecutivo.md
WORKFLOW.md
raw_results.tsv
summary_mean_sd.tsv
nuevoshallazgos.ods

# ── Claude Code session / editor / system files (not part of the project) ──
.claude/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
~$*.docx
Rplots.pdf
*.Rhistory
